<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Jaya Property 6-mth net down.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Jaya Property 6-mth net down.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Gross profit		62.26 vs 66.79</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  50.41 vs 58.59</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    48.40 vs 65.22</p>
<p>    Net profit		  42.75 vs 48.92</p>
<p>Note: The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Jaya Real Property is a property company.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
